6. Verify: magick identify OUTPUT (confirm format and dimensions). Report the exact command and output path.

## Mutation policy
Read-only magick identify inspection is always allowed when it matches the task.

Image creation or transformation is allowed only when the user asks for an output, resize, crop, conversion, compression, rotation, montage, annotation, metadata stripping, or batch action. Write only new output files, output directories, or the exact output path requested by the user.

Never overwrite an original image. For batch work, use magick mogrify -path OUTPUT_DIR by default; plain in-place mogrify is allowed only when the user explicitly requested in-place editing.

